DESCR
 Behler G1, G2, and G3 for every environment species
END DESCR

ATOM Ti

ENV 2
Ti
O

RMIN 0.35

FUNCTIONS type=Behler2011
8
G=3 type2=O  Rc=4.8 kappa=1.35
G=2 type2=Ti Rc=4.5 Rs=0.25 eta=0.42
G=1 type2=O  Rc=4.9
G=3 type2=Ti Rc=4.6 kappa=0.85
G=2 type2=O  Rc=4.7 Rs=0.00 eta=0.18
G=1 type2=Ti Rc=5.0
G=2 type2=Ti Rc=4.9 Rs=0.70 eta=0.75
G=2 type2=O  Rc=4.4 Rs=0.45 eta=1.10
